WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:04,451
Welcome back to Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

2
00:00:04,571 --> 00:00:06,310
This is Episode 40.

3
00:00:06,430 --> 00:00:08,535
Lulu is visiting today.

4
00:00:08,655 --> 00:00:11,950
She wants to put a box inside Sammy.

5
00:00:12,070 --> 00:00:13,900
But Sammy is locked.

6
00:00:14,020 --> 00:00:14,720
Oh no!

7
00:00:14,840 --> 00:00:17,769
Maya could give Lulu a name tag.

8
00:00:17,889 --> 00:00:20,543
But a name tag lasts forever.

9
00:00:20,663 --> 00:00:23,500
Lulu is only here until sunset.

10
00:00:23,620 --> 00:00:27,281
So Maya gives her a sunset pass instead.

11
00:00:27,401 --> 00:00:28,957
She sticks it on.

12
00:00:29,077 --> 00:00:29,777
Click!

13
00:00:29,897 --> 00:00:30,995
Sammy opens.

14
00:00:31,115 --> 00:00:33,495
Lulu drops her box inside.

15
00:00:33,615 --> 00:00:35,262
The sun goes down.

16
00:00:35,382 --> 00:00:38,036
The pass peels off by itself.

17
00:00:38,156 --> 00:00:39,529
It floats away.

18
00:00:39,649 --> 00:00:41,296
Sammy locks again.

19
00:00:41,416 --> 00:00:43,887
Nobody had to take it back.

20
00:00:44,007 --> 00:00:46,570
The badge is who you become.

21
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:49,435
The pass is how long it lasts.

22
00:00:49,555 --> 00:00:51,752
That is the sunset pass.

23
00:00:51,872 --> 00:00:53,428
Now you know STS!

24
00:00:53,548 --> 00:00:58,000
See you next time in Cloud Town, high up in the sky!

